<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s349S">[iv.289-96] ,dang po ni, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w1">mi <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s349m1">dge ba</span></span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w2">bcu</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w3">so so</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w4">ngo bo</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w5">gang</span> zhe na, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w6"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s349m2">srog</span> gcod pa</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w7">bsams bzhin du</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s349p1">ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w8">nor</span> bar ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w9">gzhan</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w10">bsad pa</span>&#x27;o, , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w11">bsams bzhin du</span> zhes pas <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s349p2">ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w12">bsams par</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w13">shi ba</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w14">nyes pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w15">med</span> par <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s349w16">bstan</span></span>
