<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Codex independent TIBETAN-FIRST PROVISIONAL proposal. Question and quoted-definition framing remain unwrapped. The two purposely, two negations no, and different NOR senses have explicit local ownership. Flat MA/without and NOR/mistake use their directly attested values; the unrelated mined whole adverb is not followed. Source origin 58b8846b0affaac576ace5b0789a45df1e462a53 through345; later actual acceptance baseline is separately recorded, never substituted for this origin.</div>
